    num: '02',
    title: 'Confusing "I felt moved by a documentary" with knowing you can do the daily work for years',
    body: 'Feeling a strong pull toward one identified person\'s story - the exact effect researchers have documented for decades - is not the same as being able to do the unglamorous, repetitive version of that work: the tenth case file, the fortieth night shift, the report nobody reads. Test the daily version, not the highlight-reel version.',
